        "reference": "Alma 22:5",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And also, what is this that Ammon said—If ye will repent ye shall be saved, and if ye will not repent, ye shall be cast off at the last day?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 41,
