        "reference": "Alma 22:7",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And now when Aaron heard this, his heart began to rejoice, and he said: Behold, assuredly as thou livest, O king, there is a God.",
